Seam: BUILD.gn (root), group("gn_all").
Why: GN only loads BUILD.gn files that something references. Arcium tests and
     the playground are not reachable from chrome, so gn_all lists //arcium:all.
Delegates to: arcium/BUILD.gn.

diff --git a/BUILD.gn b/BUILD.gn
index 0bd5d40ff7..6de8a71e27 100644
--- a/BUILD.gn
+++ b/BUILD.gn
@@ -97,6 +97,8 @@ group("gn_all") {
     }
   } else {
     deps = [
+      # Arcium: tests and playground; GN loads a BUILD.gn only when referenced.
+      "//arcium:all",
       "//base:base_perftests",
       "//base:base_unittests",
       "//build/modules",
